  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PURCHASE Universal Health Coverage Advocacy Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant funding for advocacy and engagement activities on universal health coverage, encompassing the development of advocacy products and evidence, events that promote universal health coverage, direct engagement with decision-makers and policymakers, and support for civil society and community advocacy and participation, including activities such as participatory budgeting. While the focus of activities will complement and align with the technical focus of the programme, in all options there remains flexibility to work across global, regional and national levels where there are opportunities to advance PURCHASE goals.</narrative>
  </description>
